## 7. Properties of the individual star-forming clumps inside ***the Cosmic Grapes***: 

We use `SExtractor` version 2.25.0(cite: bertin1996) to quantify the number of individual star-forming clumps that appear in the JWST/NIRCam maps (Extended Data Fig. [6](#fig:nircam_cutout)). Here, we adopt the NIRCam/F150W map, which provides one of the highest spatial resolutions (PSF FWHM $\simeq 0
