## Code availability.

The NIRCam data were processed with grizli available at <https://github.com/gbrammer/grizli>. The NIRCam F160W image is analyzed with `GALFIT` available at <https://users.obs.carnegiescience.edu/peng/work/galfit/galfit.html>. The ALMA data were reduced using the CASA software version 6.4.1.12 available at <https://casa.nrao.edu/casa_obtaining.shtml>. The NIRSpec data reduction code developed by the TEMPLATE team, which is available at <https://github.com/JWST-Templates/Notebooks/blob/main/nirspec_ifu_cookbook.ipynb>. The \[C ii\], H$\alpha$, and \[O iii\]$\lambda$5008 data cubes are analyzed with `3DBarolo` available at <https://editeodoro.github.io/Bbarolo/>.

## Data availability.

This paper makes use of the JWST data from #GO-1567, available at <https://archive.stsci.edu/>. The reduced JWST NIRCam images are available at <https://dawn-cph.github.io/dja/>. The ALMA data supporting our finding is from #2021.1.00055.S, available at <http://almascience.nao.ac.jp/>. The simulated galaxies in FIRE used in this study are all available at <https://flathub.flatironinstitute.org/fire>. Other datasets generated and/or analyzed during the current study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.

